    {
      "field_name": "diagnostic_criteria",
      "value": "clinical features (fluctuating rigidity and paroxysmal painful spasms of axial and/or limb muscles), antibody status (anti-glutamic acid decarboxylase antibody), EMG (electroencephalography to exclude seizure), treatment response (improvement with benzodiazepines and IVIg)",
